oofem.tm.out
2D inclusion transport — matrix + ITZ flow, low-k steel inclusion
TransientTransport nsteps 100 deltat 1.0 alpha 1.0 nmodules 1 profileopt 1
vtkxmllattice tstep_step 1 dofman_all primvars 1 5
domain 2dMassLatticeTransport
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ncrosssect 0 nmat 3 nbc 1 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 0
latticetransmat 1 d 1.e3 k 1.e-19 vis 1.e-3 thetas 1. thetar 0. contype 0 c 0. ctor 0.001
latticetransmat 2 d 1.e3 k 1.e-25 vis 1.e-3 thetas 1. thetar 0. contype 0 c 0. ctor 0.001
latticetransmat 3 d 1.e3 k 1.e-19 vis 1.e-3 thetas 1. thetar 0. contype 0 c 0. ctor 0.001
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 1 11 values 1 0.0
#@couplingbc
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.
#@couplingset
